<!--
  PRODUCT_SPEC PLAY-002 — *put the book back in my ears*, in the Android Auto player and the notification.

  Material's `headset`, deliberately the over-ear silhouette rather than the earbud one. It has to read as
  *the thing you are wearing* at a glance from a driving position and stand next to `ic_car_output` without
  either being mistaken for the other; two small buds at that size are a pair of dots. The button covers
  wired headphones, Bluetooth earbuds and hearing aids alike, so no one product shape would be honest anyway.
-->
